window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>I've been abducted by the werewolf king.</b><br> <br> He’s deadly. Violent. Cruel.<br> <br> But not to me.<br> <br> To me, he's almost <i>nice</i>.<br> <br> I guess it helps that I'm the only female werewolf he's ever met.<br> <br> And that his wolf has decided I'm going to be his mate, whether I like it or not.<br> <br> Luckily, I can survive his pack just fine, as long as no one learns what I could do for them.<br> <br> I can't tell the king the truth, no matter how much I'm starting to trust him.<br> <br> Or like him.<br> <br> Or <i>want</i> him.<br> <br> I have to stay quiet about what I can really do, or I will lose <i>everything</i>.<br> <br> Including the possessive king I'm trying hard not to fall for.<br> <br> Because I could save his people's lives… but it would cost me mine.</p> <p><b><i>*This is a spicy enemies to lovers romance with a happily ever after</i></b></p>"; 
